{"time": "20261117T172557Z", "think": "Choose the duel.", "command": "say 4", "result": "Corvus Ulvius: Corvus. Tells: he likes that; until one of them yields; if he yields, the player walks in as a guest; if the player kills him, the Rose fights them. Does: sets stage 15 (the duel begins, the yield block).\n\n*** Journal updated: The Thief's Stone ***\nJournal: Corvus Ulvius, the gate-captain, took up my challenge. He fights until he is badly hurt and then yields. If he yields, I go in as a guest. If I kill him, the whole garrison will fight me. I'm to beat him.\nObjective: Beat Corvus Ulvius in the duel until he yields. (marker: Corvus Ulvius)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 15, "at": "blackrose-prison", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-not