{"time": "20261117T172623Z", "think": "Quest is done; answer, then notes.", "command": "answer 1. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka. I killed Corvus Ulvius in the duel (he did not yield), then killed Okaz-Teel, took the Warden's Vault Key and the Seal-Stone of the Kings from the chest. The stones open the Kings' Gate at Teku-Sul Spire so the Eye can heal the Hist. 2. Take the two remaining stones: the flooded vaults of Gemin (walk from Jal-Veesa, rootworm) and the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (near Noota Nara, by boat). 3. Either order. I can fight or sneak as I choose. 4. I never learned who the Imperial buyer was, though Ennodius Vanin, the Collector, was in the hall; I did not talk to him. I also still do not know what moans in Fort Chalkmoth cellar.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn14.vault-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.corvus-ulvius", "npc.mn.okaz-teel"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic